# ==========================================================================
# Response headers — Cloudflare Pages (_headers)
# ==========================================================================

# --- Internal Markdown docs -----------------------------------------------
# The site is published from the repo root, so audit/working notes committed
# as *.md are served as public plain-text URLs. Google extracts URL-like
# strings from them (the likely source of the literal /wp-content/uploads/*
# 404 in Search Console) and can index their contents. noindex keeps them out
# of search results until the docs are moved outside the published folder.
/*.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
